msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"*pant* *pant* So what, are you some kinda livestock detective or "
"something...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"I don't know if there is such a thing. Now answer my question! What's the "
"deal with this Golden Agu pork I keep hearing about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Do I need to spell it out for you? \"Golden Agu\" is a sham, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"We buy the pork cheap from China and Australia. Then we\r\n"
"roast it up or glaze it, and no one knows the difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Selling this shit on the internet with a flashy brand name\r\n"
"rakes in ten times the profit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr "Oh, ecco di cosa si tratta..."

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Yeah. And now that you know, how about layin' off, huh?\r\n"
"After all, suckers deserve what they get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"What a filthy, filthy man you are! You ought to be ashamed\r\n"
"of yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid " "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Local Okinawans are working themselves to the bone to raise\r\n"
"up authentic agu pork, and I won't let cowards like you\r\n"
"sully their reputation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Oh no... Please, if you could find it in your hearts to forgive me... I'd be"
" ever so grateful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid " "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, we finally figured out the secret behind this porcine "
"phenomenon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Indeed, we appreciate your help. But aren't you a tad\r\n"
"disappointed I won't be getting any prettier by eating\r\n"
"high-quality pork, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Heh... I guess I am."
msgstr "Ehe. Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"The other butchers and I would like you to have this as a\r\n"
"token of our gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "We'll be taking this fraud to the cops now. Thanks again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2712"
msgid "President"
msgstr "Presidente"

msgctxt "2716"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2720"
msgid "Middle-aged Woman"
msgstr "Donna di mezza età"

msgctxt "2724"
msgid "Market Worker"
msgstr ""
